Extraction helper:
```python
def extract_env(txt, env, label=None, contains=None):
    for m in re.finditer(r'\\begin\{'+env+r'\}(.*?)\\end\{'+env+r'\}', txt, re.S):
        body=m.group(1)
        if label and ('\\label{'+label+'}' not in body): continue
        if contains and contains not in body: continue
        return body
    return None
```
